@@ -118,6 +118,10 @@ The server draws a disabled bond set **D**: **3 core + 4 add-on** in NORMAL/HARD
 
 **An operator is banned iff all its bonds ∈ D.** At 3 + 4 that averages ≈22 banned operators. The briefing shows lit and greyed bonds plus the banned list; the in-match dropdown shows banned counts per bond. The rule reproduces a real screenshot's counts (7/6/5/5/5/4/3) exactly (01 A2).
 
+**Remake adjustment (owner decision 2026-10-13, not official):** with the two custom core bonds (东/乌萨斯) the core pool grew 8 → 10, so the draw is **5 core + 5 add-on** in NORMAL/HARD/ABYSS (config `data/config.json → bans`, built by tools/build-data.mjs) — scaled to keep the average available operators at the 0.2.1 baseline of ≈90 (MC: 0.2.1 3+4 → 22.0 banned / 90.0 available; 10-core 5+5 → 33.5 / 91.5). The draw still only filters the shop pool: a drawn bond stays activatable (computeBonds never reads the ban set) — its members that survive (multi-bond ones via their other bonds, plus 调和's +1) still reach the thresholds; only 阿戈尔 shows a real (2.7 %) risk of not even reaching its lowest tier with 调和. Weight remains a draw-eligibility gate, not a sampler weight.
+
+**Remake adjustment 2 (owner decision 2026-10-17, not official):** 协防干员 (`emptyShip`) joins the draw — its `weight` goes 0 → 10 in `tools/custom-content.mjs` (`BOND_WEIGHT_OVERRIDES`, applied in `injectCustomContent` before any builder), so the add-on pool is **12**. 投资人 (`investShip`) explicitly stays weight 0 = never banned (调和 / 绝技 too). Self-selected (`自选编队`) pieces are exempt from the 协防 ban: `server/match/player/diy.js → buildDiyStock` drops `economy.fallbackBondId` from a DIY record's bonds before the all-bonds-off test, so a factionless pick and every prototype (all `['emptyShip']`) keep their stock — the player-facing promise "协防不会被禁用" holds. The draw becomes **7 core + 4 add-on** in NORMAL/HARD/ABYSS (same ≈90 criterion; exact closed form + 200k MC + the production `drawDisabledBonds`: 10-core 7+4 → 36.7 banned / 88.3 available vs 0.2.1's 22.0 / 90.0). Fun side effects, all measured: 阿戈尔 drops to 4.8 mean available members (0.27 % risk below its lowest tier with 调和), FUNNY's add-on candidate pool is 7 so 协防 is drawn there ~14.9 % of the time, and the per-match banned count now ranges 23–50. ⚠️ The closed form used in the earlier 禁用机制速查 §11.3 grid treated a piece's several same-pool bonds as independent draws; the correct (without-replacement) form is `C(C−c, nC−c)/C(C, nC) × C(A−a, nA−a)/C(A, nA)` — the §11.2 grid is ~1 low. Full evaluation: 禁用机制速查.md §12.
